  "subject": "情报科学研究科_情报基础数学",
  "text": "对非零复数 $a,b,c$，数列 $\\{z_n\\}$ 定义为\n$$z_1=a,\\quad z_2=b,\\quad z_n=c\\cdot\\frac{z_{n-1}}{z_{n-2}}\\quad(n=3,4,\\ldots).$$\n(i) 求 $z_7$。\n(ii) 求 $\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\\sum_{k=1}^n z_k$。",
  "knowledge_points": [
    "复数列递推关系",
    "周期性数列",
    "Cesàro平均",
    "极限计算"
  ],
  "question_type": "复数递推数列的周期性与均值",
  "method": [
    "逐项递推计算",
    "发现周期规律",
    "周期数列的Cesàro均值公式"
  ],
  "solution_steps": [
    "逐项计算 $z_3,z_4,z_5,z_6,z_7$，发现数列以5为周期",
    "验证 $z_7=z_1=a$，$z_8=z_2=b$，确认周期为5",
    "利用周期性，Cesàro平均的极限等于一个周期内各项之和除以周期长度",
    "计算一个周期 $z_1+z_2+z_3+z_4+z_5$ 之和并除以5得到极限"
  ],
  "math_structure": {
    "type": "periodic_recurrence_cesaro_mean",
    "template": "z_1=a,z_2=b,z_n=c\\cdot z_{n-1}/z_{n-2},\\ \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\\sum_{k=1}^n z_k",
    "variable_count": 3
  },
  "difficulty": 4,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "i)",
      "steps": [
        "$z_3=c\\cdot z_2/z_1=cb/a$",
        "$z_4=c\\cdot z_3/z_2=c\\cdot(cb/a)/b=c^2/a$",
        "$z_5=c\\cdot z_4/z_3=c\\cdot(c^2/a)/(cb/a)=c^2/b$",
        "$z_6=c\\cdot z_5/z_4=c\\cdot(c^2/b)/(c^2/a)=ca/b$",
        "$z_7=c\\cdot z_6/z_5=c\\cdot(ca/b)/(c^2/b)=a$",
        "验证：继续算 $z_8=c\\cdot z_7/z_6=c\\cdot a/(ca/b)=b=z_2$，确认数列以5为周期，故 $z_7=a$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": "ii)",
      "steps": [
        "由(i)知数列周期为5：$z_1=a,z_2=b,z_3=cb/a,z_4=c^2/a,z_5=c^2/b$，且$z_{n+5}=z_n$对所有$n$成立",
        "对周期数列，Cesàro平均的极限等于一个周期内各项算术平均：$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\\sum_{k=1}^n z_k=\\frac{z_1+z_2+z_3+z_4+z_5}{5}$",
        "计算周期和：$S=a+b+\\dfrac{cb}{a}+\\dfrac{c^2}{a}+\\dfrac{c^2}{b}$，通分（分母$ab$）：$S=\\dfrac{a^2b+ab^2+cb^2+bc^2+ac^2}{ab}$",
        "最终结果：$\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac1n\\sum_{k=1}^n z_k=\\frac{a^2b+ab^2+cb^2+bc^2+ac^2}{5ab}$"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "practice_questions": [
