      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "periodic_recurrence_cesaro_mean",
        "template": "z_1=a,z_2=b,z_n=c z_{n-1}/z_{n-2},\\text{求}z_6",
        "variable_count": 3
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 8,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "$z_3=cb/a$",
            "$z_4=c\\cdot(cb/a)/b=c^2/a$",
            "$z_5=c\\cdot(c^2/a)/(cb/a)=c^2/b$",
            "$z_6=c\\cdot(c^2/b)/(c^2/a)=ca/b$，与所求一致"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "osaka-2010-d2b8f5102c-q04-practice-02",
      "school": "大阪大学",
      "year": "2010"
    },
    {
      "text": "证明对一般的 $a,b,c\\ne0$，数列 $\\{z_n\\}$ 满足 $z_{n+5}=z_n$ 对所有 $n\\ge1$ 成立（即证明周期为5）。",
      "knowledge_points": [
        "数列周期性证明",
        "代数归纳"
      ],
      "question_type": "周期性证明",
      "method": [
        "逐项计算验证首个周期",
        "利用递推关系归纳证明后续周期"
      ],
      "solution_steps": [
        "计算z1至z7验证z6=z1周期性起点",
        "说明由递推关系的确定性(仅依赖前两项)得到整体周期性"
      ],
      "math_structure": {
        "type": "periodic_recurrence_cesaro_mean",
        "template": "\\text{证明}z_{n+5}=z_n\\ \\forall n",
        "variable_count": 3
      },
      "difficulty": 3,
      "estimated_minutes": 10,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "结果",
          "steps": [
            "计算得 $z_6=ca/b,\\,z_7=a=z_1$（如(i)所示）",
            "继续计算 $z_8=c\\cdot z_7/z_6=c\\cdot a/(ca/b)=b=z_2$",
            "由于递推关系 $z_n=c z_{n-1}/z_{n-2}$ 完全由前两项决定后续所有项，而 $(z_6,z_7)=(ca/b,a)$与$(z_1,z_2)=(a,b)$的关系是：$z_7=z_1,z_8=z_2$，即从第6项开始的两项序列与原序列的第1，2项通过相同递推规则生成后续项，故对所有 $n\\ge1$ 有 $z_{n+5}=z_n$，周期为5得证"
          ]
        }
      ],
